{"title":"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_October_2025)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remarks (added by pf02, October 2025)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af79b4a9ce12bf142dd5596d6fb852f98dd11a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^n_{k=0}\\binom{2n+1}{2k+1}2^{3k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"134\" height=\"56\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for any integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2ee0b9f98fbe4e16ed41464f63c5d8b4123ba4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Everything that follows takes place in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/9/139dae47e0e3f82c2a74fb38ae805431611f603a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb F_5(\\sqrt 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"21\" />, i.e. the field we get by adjoining a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1226014633b93a4af77c1b358235a130ee6be3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2=0$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9bc2ca26617ba663b7a57dc8ea828998b5be77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb F_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, the field with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> elements.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/361c13b6a64001cb9352744c42f0a22036a4bc23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom{2n+1}{2k+1}2^{3k}=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom{2n+1}{2n-2k}3^k=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom{2n+1}{2(n-k)}2^{-k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"465\" height=\"53\" />. Now, this is zero iff it's zero when we multiply it by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so we may as well prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841b98761f6bdc676f734ae8af50d5a3163fd5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom{2n+1}{2(n-k)}\\sqrt 2^{2(n-k)}\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"226\" height=\"56\" />. The LHS is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f2674ceebed986bf49898f5f0126f22e8097ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\sqrt 2)^{2n+1}=\\alpha+\\beta\\sqrt 2,\\ \\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb F_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"279\" height=\"21\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/646083b93a275a4eefd20ab7814c3c3b27af3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-\\sqrt 2)^{2n+1}=\\alpha-\\beta\\sqrt 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"21\" />, so by multiplying them we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77a7bb7c6e8e41ebd72b3dbd73514311766f14af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1=\\alpha^2-2\\beta^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />. If we were to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11e9c9370965f44fe5bd812e80c12fccbeec1a17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=0$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, then we would get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffcc212f2dc3d9c75256b8af0561d169c1c9d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1=2\\beta^2,\\ \\beta\\in\\mathbb F_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />, and this is impossible, since it would make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c742b91d7cce68baeb83fb2f979b0dd2c8450de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3=2^{-1}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> a square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/04777e262a979166a6295fb67e24ca75bc42f3b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9bc2ca26617ba663b7a57dc8ea828998b5be77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb F_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> (i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would be a quadratic residue modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and it's not).\n</p><p>The above solution was posted and copyrighted by grobber.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Remarks_.28added_by_pf02.2C_October_2025.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_October_2025)\">Remarks (added by pf02, October 2025)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Remarks (added by pf02, October 2025)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>1. On the discussion page <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c6h58616\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c6h58616</a>\nthere are several variations of this solution, as well as solutions which\ncan be called different from this one.  It is worth looking at them.\n</p><p>2.  As of today, the AI engines Gemini (from Google) and ChatGPT\ngive correct solutions to this problem.  The two solutions are\nessentially the same, and they are the same as one of the solutions\nfrom the discussion page.  The prompt I gave to the AI engines was\n`prove that sum from k=0 to k=n of (\"2n+1 choose 2k+1\" * 2^(3k))\nis not divisible by 5 for any n \\ge 0'.\n</p><p><br />\nThe original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p359102\">[1]</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO\" title=\"1974 IMO\">1974 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171702\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 143/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3915/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.619      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.619      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16049:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171702 and revision id 262390. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}